1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,716
Day one of
world domination.

2
00:00:03,756 --> 00:00:06,054
You said that yesterday.

3
00:00:06,094 --> 00:00:08,748
Yesterday was a rehearsal.

4
00:00:08,788 --> 00:00:16,619
Behold: the Adoration Ray.
One shot, and every creature
on Earth will adore me.

5
00:00:16,659 --> 00:00:18,693
Every creature?

6
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:23,613
Every. Single. One.
On my count. Three...

7
00:00:24,383 --> 00:00:26,602
I said on my count!

8
00:00:26,642 --> 00:00:29,366
You were taking forever.

9
00:00:32,936 --> 00:00:34,657
It's working.

10
00:00:34,697 --> 00:00:36,524
It's pigeons.

11
00:00:36,564 --> 00:00:39,288
Pigeons are creatures.

12
00:00:39,658 --> 00:00:46,222
Stop. Stop looking
at me like that...
Okay, one more minute.

13
00:00:46,942 --> 00:00:49,133
Rent's due Friday.

14
00:00:49,173 --> 00:00:51,897
My army will handle it.

15
00:00:52,167 --> 00:00:54,186
That's a bottle cap.
